1
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:19,880
The script is right here.

2
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,020
There's a mutiny outside.

3
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:32,119
Our enemies are already at the door.

4
00:00:32,119 --> 00:00:33,980
I can't possibly escape with you.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,240
You swore an oath.

6
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:40,520
You said you'd take me far away tonight.

7
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:42,640
I betrayed the entire troupe for you.

8
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:44,760
I'm sorry.

9
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:45,560
Yue'er,

10
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:48,440
I need your life to buy me some time.

11
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,600
It was all a lie.

12
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,800
So much for life and death together.

13
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:07,480
Human hearts are only selfish.

14
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:11,160
I want this theater to never know peace.

15
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:15,960
I want all hypocrites

16
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:19,240
to kill their true loves
with their own hands on this stage.

17
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:33,560
The last shot wasn't wasted.

18
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:36,960
Su Lingyue,

19
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:38,960
look closely.

20
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:42,039
Not everyone will betray their friends
to survive.

21
00:01:42,039 --> 00:01:44,840
Your curse ends here today.

22
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:13,480
So there really are people in this world

23
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:17,440
willing to give up their lives for others.

24
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:20,480
I trapped them.

25
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:21,880
And I trapped myself too.

26
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:23,340
For a whole hundred years.

27
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:26,320
All the prosperity sung out,

28
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:36,680
it was just a grand illusion in the end.

29
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:41,000
Go, go now!

30
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:43,360
It's too heavy. Leave me.

31
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,320
Take them away.

32
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:46,160
I just snatched you back
from the jaws of death.

33
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:47,320
You want to die here?

34
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:49,160
In your dreams. Catch your breath.

35
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:49,720
Let's go.

36
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,360
You did it.

37
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:05,840
After 47 years, someone finally did it.

38
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,040
Wait a minute.

39
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:17,400
Your master was a good man.

40
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:20,560
When he came in, he was the 32nd lead.

41
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,500
He didn't kill his commander.

42
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,960
He'd rather be trapped himself

43
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,920
than hurt the innocent.

44
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:37,560
I've been a forensic doctor for 26 years.

45
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,160
Thousands of bodies have passed
through my hands.

46
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:42,440
Every cut was only
to seek justice for the dead.

47
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:44,240
If you think I'd hate Hanzi,

48
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:46,040
then you're dead wrong.

49
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:48,079
He is my, Zhou Yuanming's, apprentice.

50
00:03:48,079 --> 00:03:51,079
I protect him far more
than I seek justice for myself.

51
00:03:57,840 --> 00:04:02,040
Master, what you said about
no personal feelings under the knife,

52
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:05,360
it took me three years
to truly understand.

53
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:08,400
You weren't telling me
to become an emotionless machine.

54
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,460
You were telling me

55
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,880
that emotions can't be an excuse
to avoid the truth.

56
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:15,080
But emotions themselves are never wrong.

57
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:18,440
That's exactly what your master said
when he left.

58
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,240
He said,

59
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:20,600
tell my Hanzi,

60
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,380
his master doesn't blame him.

61
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:32,840
Fourth stop.

62
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,320
Blood-Stained Pear Garden, cleared.

63
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:35,920
Clear method: Rewrite the script,

64
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:36,800
destroy the source.

65
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,440
Xiao Han, clear rating S+.

66
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:41,480
Core Breaker, 1,200 points.

67
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:43,400
Liu Yiyang, clear rating S.

68
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:45,720
Sacrificial Assistant, 1,000 points.

69
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:48,720
Fatty, Qiqi, Lin Xiaofei, clear rating A.

70
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:50,960
Tactical Support, 600 points.

71
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,040
Han got the highest score again this time.

72
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:55,040
Why am I always the tool?

73
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:57,409
Your pot of hot oil
was worth 1,000 points.

74
00:04:58,760 --> 00:05:01,090
Well, your tripwires weren't bad either.

75
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:04,720
Dr. Xiao, can you give me
a straight answer?

76
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:08,080
How sure were you about that cut just now?

77
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,040
Seventy percent.

78
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,040
Seventy percent?

79
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:13,960
The tactile feedback of holding a dagger
is different from a scalpel.

80
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:17,490
Plus, your unsteady breathing caused
slight chest movements.

81
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:20,800
Overall, there's a 70% chance.

82
00:05:23,080 --> 00:05:23,880
Xiao Han,

83
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:26,040
you're truly insane.

84
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:29,600
But you survived.
